sequenceDiagram
    actor Utilisateur
    participant Frontend
    participant Generation
    participant Retrieval
    participant Weaviate
    participant LLM

    Utilisateur->>Frontend: Poser une question
    Frontend->>Generation: POST /ask
    Generation->>Retrieval: Rechercher passages pertinents
    Retrieval->>Weaviate: Recherche vectorielle / hybride
    Weaviate-->>Retrieval: Passages recuperes
    Retrieval-->>Generation: Chunks classes
    Generation->>LLM: Generer la reponse contextualisee
    LLM-->>Generation: Reponse + citations
    Generation-->>Frontend: Reponse finale
    Frontend-->>Utilisateur: Affichage de la reponse
